# File & Component Structure

## Max File Size
- 200 lines max per file
- Break into reusable, well-named components

## Reusability
- Reused UI patterns → create component
- Refactor inline usage to adopt it

## Imports
- Explicitly import all required modules
- No "undefined" errors from missing imports

## Theming
- Support light/dark themes (unless documented otherwise)

## Responsiveness
- Fully responsive, mobile-friendly layouts
- Smooth transitions between breakpoints
- Effective use of Tailwind responsive utilities
